##

00:00:00.034 --> 00:00:02.640 line:91%
Six years ago, I got an invitation
to go around a bobsleigh track,

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.590 line:91%
and I was too scared
and I turned it down.

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.560 align:end position:100% line:91%
But since then, these folks have
been helping run this channel,

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.960 align:end size:94% position:94% line:91%
and they got me over my
fear of roller coasters.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:10.920 line:85%
So thank you for that.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.640 align:start size:94% position:6% line:91%
This is Chris Spring,
world-class bobsleigh athlete,

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.520 line:91%
and this is the Whistler
Sliding Centre in Canada.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.490 line:91%
So for the season finale,
for the Christmas special,

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.580 line:91%
we brought the entire team
out here to Canada,

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.138 line:91%
and we're gonna throw ourselves
down a bobsleigh track.

00:00:26.795 --> 00:00:27.600 line:85%
<c.yellow>Wait, what?</c>

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.545 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(group laughing)</i></c>

00:00:28.545 --> 00:00:30.600 line:91%
Oh, don't pretend
you don't know!

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.912 line:91%
Which includes, by the
way, the camera team.

00:00:36.001 --> 00:00:39.203 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (dramatic bluesy rock music)</i></c>

00:00:51.945 --> 00:00:53.115 line:91%
<c.cyan>Hello.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Hello.</c>

00:00:53.805 --> 00:00:54.603 line:85%
<c.cyan>How's it going?</c>

00:00:55.245 --> 00:00:56.175 line:85%
Going well. Tom.

00:00:56.175 --> 00:00:58.265 align:end size:97% position:97% line:91%
<c.cyan>Welcome to the Sliding Centre.
My name is Philippe.</c>

00:00:58.265 --> 00:01:01.005 align:end size:94% position:94% line:91%
<c.cyan>I'm gonna be showing you
a few things before we go.</c>

00:01:01.005 --> 00:01:02.745 line:91%
<c.cyan>So follow me and
we can get started.</c>

00:01:02.745 --> 00:01:03.391 line:85%
Right.

00:01:04.215 --> 00:01:06.285 position:58% line:91%
<c.cyan>You're gonna go down the
fastest, steepest track in the world.</c>

00:01:06.285 --> 00:01:08.985 line:91%
<c.cyan>So on average, speed for
track is 135km an hour.</c>

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.790 line:91%
<c.cyan>Here, top speed is
155 from the top.</c>

00:01:11.795 --> 00:01:12.930 line:85%
<c.cyan>So big jump.</c>

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.610 line:91%
<c.cyan>We need to regroom
the track by hand,</c>

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:16.560 line:91%
<c.cyan>believe it or not,
because of the speed.</c>

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.030 line:91%
<c.cyan>So that's what
the guys are doing.</c>

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.730 line:91%
<c.cyan>So, a little warning
about the ride.</c>

00:01:21.078 --> 00:01:22.161 line:85%
<c.cyan>You might not like it.</c>

00:01:25.634 --> 00:01:28.095 line:91%
<c.cyan>And there's nothing we
can do about it, okay?</c>

00:01:28.664 --> 00:01:30.145 line:85%
Yeah, once you start, that's it.

00:01:30.145 --> 00:01:31.365 line:85%
You're in it for the ride.

00:01:31.365 --> 00:01:32.745 line:85%
<c.cyan>It's nothing like you expect.</c>

00:01:32.895 --> 00:01:35.155 line:91%
<c.cyan>You're gonna pull
three to four G-forces,</c>

00:01:35.175 --> 00:01:37.485 line:91%
<c.cyan>so you're gonna weigh three
to four times your weight.</c>

00:01:37.995 --> 00:01:41.235 line:91%
<c.cyan>Those are positive Gs,
means it's pressure on you.</c>

00:01:41.535 --> 00:01:43.368 line:91%
<c.cyan>There's no negative Gs.
The negative Gs,</c>

00:01:43.368 --> 00:01:45.167 line:91%
<c.cyan>that's what you experience
in a roller coaster.</c>

00:01:45.225 --> 00:01:48.345 line:91%
<c.cyan>When the stomach goes up,
drop, upside down.</c>

00:01:48.345 --> 00:01:49.825 line:91%
<c.cyan>We don't have that.
It's not scary.</c>

00:01:50.155 --> 00:01:51.630 line:91%
<c.cyan>The athletes, when they
start from the top,</c>

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:53.630 line:85%
<c.cyan>they go up to 155 km,</c>

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.840 line:85%
<c.cyan>five to six Gs on their back.</c>

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.067 line:91%
<c.cyan>That's why they only go
for three runs a day</c>

00:01:58.067 --> 00:01:59.467 line:85%
<c.cyan>or two, never more.</c>

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.300 line:91%
<c.cyan>After three, they really
can't take it anymore.</c>

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.120 line:91%
<c.cyan>So it's three minutes or two
minutes of training per day.</c>

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:04.826 line:85%
Wow.

00:02:04.826 --> 00:02:06.818 line:91%
<c.cyan>Because after that,
you feel really tired,</c>

00:02:06.818 --> 00:02:07.840 line:85%
<c.cyan>and you can't take it anymore.</c>

00:02:09.247 --> 00:02:10.939 line:91%
<c.cyan>So if you have any
heart condition,</c>

00:02:10.939 --> 00:02:12.930 line:85%
<c.cyan>any hand, neck, back injury,</c>

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.890 line:91%
<c.cyan>pregnant, osteoporosis,
please don't go.</c>

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.300 line:85%
<c.cyan>We're really serious about that.</c>

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:16.958 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.cyan>Okay?</c>

00:02:16.958 --> 00:02:18.190 line:91%
<c.cyan>We have one crew
member who has a...</c>

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.310 line:91%
<c.cyan>will not be going
for medical reasons.</c>

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:21.750 line:91%
So that's...
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(crew laughing)</i></c>

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.308 line:91%
Okay, I didn't know if
you wanted to mention

00:02:23.308 --> 00:02:24.660 line:85%
that on camera or not!

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.000 line:91%
I was just gonna say
"medical reasons."

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.170 line:85%
That's fine.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:29.840 line:85%
<c.cyan>So when there's a cut,</c>

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.772 line:91%
<c.cyan>like the one on a
competition sled,</c>

00:02:31.772 --> 00:02:33.180 line:85%
<c.cyan>the nose can move.</c>

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.470 line:85%
<c.cyan>The nose is articulated.</c>

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:37.319 line:91%
<c.cyan>And when the nose
can move like that,</c>

00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:39.120 line:91%
<c.cyan>the sled can go higher
in the corner,</c>

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.419 line:91%
<c.cyan>and the back falls, and
they can get more speed.</c>

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:44.390 line:91%
<c.cyan>The downside is they can
go too high and they crash.</c>

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.310 line:85%
<c.cyan>So they're easy to crash.</c>

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:47.960 line:91%
<c.cyan>The other one is
called a plank sled.</c>

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.107 line:85%
<c.cyan>There's no cut.</c>

00:02:49.267 --> 00:02:52.683 line:91%
<c.cyan>They're slower,
smoother, safer,</c>

00:02:52.683 --> 00:02:55.500 line:91%
<c.cyan>but because they're slower,
we don't use them with the public.</c>

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:56.760 line:85%
<c.cyan>We're gonna use a real one.</c>

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.470 line:85%
Oh wow, okay.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.470 line:91%
<c.yellow>So we're going in the
less safe one?</c>

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.079 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yes.</c>
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>

00:03:01.079 --> 00:03:02.031 line:85%
We're going with the faster one.

00:03:02.031 --> 00:03:03.585 line:85%
<c.cyan>I wouldn't call it less safe.</c>

00:03:03.959 --> 00:03:05.850 line:85%
<c.cyan>I call them the more fun one.</c>

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:07.130 line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(others laughing)</i></c>
<c.cyan>Alright?</c>

00:03:08.464 --> 00:03:10.470 line:91%
<c.cyan>We're gonna start you from
corner seven, not the top.</c>

00:03:11.067 --> 00:03:12.480 line:85%
<c.cyan>There's different reasons for that.</c>

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.579 line:85%
<c.cyan>So the top is... it's hell.</c>

00:03:15.285 --> 00:03:18.015 line:91%
<c.cyan>The one reason we don't start from
the top is because of this corner.</c>

00:03:18.015 --> 00:03:19.695 line:85%
<c.cyan>You see that fake straight line?</c>

00:03:19.695 --> 00:03:21.945 line:91%
<c.cyan>This is the hardest corner
in the world by far.</c>

00:03:22.275 --> 00:03:25.845 line:91%
<c.cyan>The athlete during the 2010
Olympics named it 50-50.</c>

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.705 line:91%
<c.cyan>We thought that was a
funny name, so we kept it.</c>

00:03:27.885 --> 00:03:28.913 line:85%
<c.green>50-50 what?</c>

00:03:29.802 --> 00:03:32.865 line:91%
<c.cyan>50% chance to go through it
properly on your runners.</c>

00:03:33.015 --> 00:03:35.067 line:91%
Oh, wow.
Or 50% chance of...

00:03:35.067 --> 00:03:36.315 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Okay, yeah, cool.</c>

00:03:36.315 --> 00:03:37.585 line:91%
Let's not go
full-speed through that.

00:03:38.575 --> 00:03:39.975 line:85%
<c.cyan>So this is what could happen.</c>

00:03:40.641 --> 00:03:41.800 line:85%
<c.cyan>If you're in a crash,</c>

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.225 line:91%
<c.cyan>the sled's gonna slide
on its side or upside down</c>

00:03:44.225 --> 00:03:45.705 line:85%
<c.cyan>all the way to the bottom.</c>

00:03:45.705 --> 00:03:47.969 line:91%
<c.cyan>We have staff waiting with
some hooks at the bottom</c>

00:03:47.969 --> 00:03:49.185 line:85%
<c.cyan>in case of a crash.</c>

00:03:49.185 --> 00:03:50.955 line:91%
<c.cyan>And then the staff's
gonna stop you.</c>

00:03:51.315 --> 00:03:53.745 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's gonna help you to exit
the sled and the track,</c>

00:03:54.255 --> 00:03:55.575 line:91%
<c.cyan>and you're gonna have a
good story for tonight.</c>

00:03:56.175 --> 00:03:56.675 line:85%
Okay.

00:03:57.225 --> 00:03:58.163 line:85%
<c.green>Does it happen often?</c>

00:03:59.055 --> 00:04:02.267 line:85%
<c.cyan>Uhh... <00:04:01.470><c>no.</c></c>

00:04:03.705 --> 00:04:05.294 line:85%
<c.yellow>I do not believe you, okay?</c>

00:04:05.925 --> 00:04:07.304 line:91%
Alright.
<c.cyan>That's it, ready to go?</c>

00:04:07.695 --> 00:04:08.805 line:91%
Ready.
<c.cyan>Alright.  </c><c.green>  Ready.</c>

00:04:08.805 --> 00:04:09.825 line:85%
<c.cyan>Let's drive to the top.</c>

00:04:11.025 --> 00:04:14.309 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (uplifting holiday music)</i></c>

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:26.895 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>Ready for some bobsledding?</c>

00:04:26.895 --> 00:04:28.672 line:85%
Yeah. We are sled number one.

00:04:28.922 --> 00:04:30.956 line:91%
Sled number two is
behind the various cameras

00:04:30.956 --> 00:04:32.985 line:91%
here at the minute,
so, yeah.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.140 line:85%
My nerves haven't kicked in yet.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:35.950 line:85%
Have they for you?

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:36.709 line:85%
<c.yellow>Long ago.</c>

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:37.810 line:91%
Okay.
<c.green>Yeah, they did.</c>

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:40.180 line:91%
<c.green>They've dissipated a bit,
but they'll come back.</c>

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.147 line:85%
<c.green>I'm waiting.</c>

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:44.397 line:91%
<c.green>Honestly didn't realise it
didn't have a back for realsies.</c>

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.137 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>Yeah, no back door.</c>

00:04:47.575 --> 00:04:48.370 line:85%
<c.green>Until this morning.</c>

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.570 line:85%
There's a little bit of a lip.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:50.500 line:85%
You'll be fine.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:51.380 line:85%
Just hold on.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:53.510 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>Yeah, you'll be
surprised how much</c>

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:55.430 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>the pressure will
squish you into place.</c>

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:55.930 line:85%
<c.green>Okay.</c>

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.820 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>And not allow you
to fall out the back.</c>

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.320 line:91%
So how long have
you been doing this?

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:02.400 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>This is my 16th year
as a bobsledder.</c>

00:05:02.984 --> 00:05:03.645 line:85%
Wow.

00:05:03.645 --> 00:05:04.484 line:85%
We did the research.

00:05:04.484 --> 00:05:07.585 line:91%
You're most decorated
Olympian bobsledder,

00:05:07.585 --> 00:05:09.195 line:91%
most decorated Canadian
Olympian in the house?

00:05:09.195 --> 00:05:10.483 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>Well, I don't know about that,</c>

00:05:10.483 --> 00:05:14.505 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>but I've definitely been to
four Olympic games, which is...</c>

00:05:15.494 --> 00:05:19.695 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>one less than one other
Olympic bobsledder.</c>

00:05:19.695 --> 00:05:20.294 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>Yeah.</c>

00:05:20.294 --> 00:05:22.215 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>But we couldn't get him
to come here today.</c>

00:05:22.215 --> 00:05:23.864 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>So you have me.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>We're both—</c>

00:05:23.864 --> 00:05:24.914 line:85%
I'm trying to be not too awkward,

00:05:24.914 --> 00:05:26.174 line:91%
and you're trying to be
nice and Canadian.

00:05:26.174 --> 00:05:28.275 line:91%
You're self-deprecating
here and, alright.

00:05:28.275 --> 00:05:29.174 line:85%
We're in good hands then.

00:05:29.174 --> 00:05:30.095 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>You are in good hands, yeah.</c>

00:05:30.101 --> 00:05:32.414 line:85%
This is... a heck of a run.

00:05:32.955 --> 00:05:35.025 line:91%
I'm just looking at that and going,
that doesn't look that steep.

00:05:35.025 --> 00:05:37.317 line:85%
It's a long way down, but...

00:05:37.317 --> 00:05:39.673 line:91%
Am I sorta doing pride
before a fall here?

00:05:39.673 --> 00:05:40.748 line:85%
'Cause I did—

00:05:40.945 --> 00:05:41.911 line:85%
You're nodding.

00:05:41.911 --> 00:05:42.960 line:85%
<c.green>I've seen the track, mate.</c>

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.160 line:85%
Okay, this is the thing.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.320 line:91%
They've seen it, they've
recce'd and I haven't.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.640 line:85%
This is all I've seen.

00:05:48.237 --> 00:05:50.188 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>Right here it
doesn't look too steep,</c>

00:05:50.188 --> 00:05:51.367 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>but once we get going...</c>

00:05:52.263 --> 00:05:54.960 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>By corner 11, 12, 13,
it really starts picking up,</c>

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:57.072 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>and you'll start to
feel that pressure</c>

00:05:57.072 --> 00:05:58.560 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>that I was talking about.</c>

00:05:58.560 --> 00:05:59.910 line:85%
How long's the run gonna be?

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:01.260 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>Around 40 seconds.</c>

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.069 line:91%
<c.yellow>Sounds quick, but...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>It does!</c>

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.030 line:91%
<c.green>I'll let you know
when we get down.</c>

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.028 line:85%
How are you feeling about it?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:11.100 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, I feel like the first
few corners are gonna be okay,</c>

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.480 line:91%
<c.yellow>and we'll probably
get cocky, and then...</c>

00:06:14.355 --> 00:06:15.602 line:85%
<c.yellow>our heads will start doing this.</c>

00:06:16.935 --> 00:06:20.235 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>Yeah, especially if you don't
know which way the corners go.</c>

00:06:20.235 --> 00:06:22.275 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>I'm not sure how much you
studied the track or not.</c>

00:06:22.275 --> 00:06:23.475 line:91%
We did not.
<c.colorFFCC88><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:06:23.475 --> 00:06:25.815 line:91%
In hindsight, that would've
been a really good idea.

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:28.762 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>Your instinct will kick in
when things do start,</c>

00:06:28.762 --> 00:06:31.060 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>you know, rattling around
quite a bit and you'll end up...</c>

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:31.902 line:85%
Yeah.

00:06:31.902 --> 00:06:34.640 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>kinda resorting to that
turtle type shape that you'll make.</c>

00:06:34.815 --> 00:06:36.805 line:91%
How much steering
is involved in it?

00:06:36.805 --> 00:06:38.335 line:85%
'Cause we got told basically:

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.219 line:91%
Skeleton, goes down on
its own more or less.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.739 line:85%
Luge, really, really difficult.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.109 line:91%
Bobsleigh, you have to
know your line.

00:06:46.109 --> 00:06:47.727 line:91%
You have to come through.
It's not like...

00:06:47.727 --> 00:06:50.097 line:91%
It's not like if you didn't steer,
it would just go slower.

00:06:50.097 --> 00:06:51.277 line:85%
If you didn't steer, it would...

00:06:52.125 --> 00:06:53.925 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>Exactly yeah.
We would be on our heads.</c>

00:06:53.925 --> 00:06:54.633 line:85%
Right.

00:06:55.228 --> 00:06:56.811 line:91%
<c.yellow>And how much of
"on our heads"</c>

00:06:56.811 --> 00:06:58.335 line:85%
<c.yellow>is there actually when we...?</c>

00:06:58.905 --> 00:07:01.125 line:91%
<c.yellow>'Cause I saw these little
guardy things up here.</c>

00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:05.385 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>Yeah, they put these in
for the public ride here.</c>

00:07:05.385 --> 00:07:07.245 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorFFCC88>We have these extra little humps.</c>

00:07:07.245 --> 00:07:10.594 line:91%
<c.colorFFCC88>It's mainly just the visual to make
